Rationale: The claim states that the movie starring Augustus Prew was directed by the founder of Klasky Csupo. While it is established that Augustus Prew starred in 'Copperhead (2013 film)' and 'Dear David,' and that these were directed by Ron Maxwell and John McPhail respectively, the founders of Klasky Csupo are Arlene Klasky and Gábor Csupó. There is no evidence that either Ron Maxwell or John McPhail founded Klasky Csupo, thus the claim is contradicted.
